            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "order": 3,
        "text": {
          "zh": "另外用[[card:Mine Collapse|矿井塌方]]配合[[card:Hexhaven Invigorator|赫克海文茁茂兽]]的[[card:Valakut, the Molten Pinnacle|熔天顶瓦拉库]]套牌，本周也终于拿下挑战赛八强：deck:fcd13e84caf0c7af79a9",
          "en": "A [[card:Valakut, the Molten Pinnacle|Valakut, the Molten Pinnacle]] deck pairing [[card:Mine Collapse|Mine Collapse]] with [[card:Hexhaven Invigorator|Hexhaven Invigorator]] also finally made a Challenge Top 8 this week: deck:fcd13e84caf0c7af79a9"
        },
